WEBVTT

00:00:00.059 --> 00:00:01.064
Your Shopify catalog

00:00:01.089 --> 00:00:01.894
can look fine

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:03.711
and still hide costly problems.

00:00:03.948 --> 00:00:05.007
Duplicate tags.

00:00:05.244 --> 00:00:06.269
Missing alt text.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.299
Weak SEO.

00:00:07.548 --> 00:00:09.394
Pricing and inventory issues.

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.342
StoreCheck scans your catalog

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:12.511
and turns the mess into

00:00:12.536 --> 00:00:13.769
a clear health score,

00:00:13.879 --> 00:00:15.123
category breakdowns,

00:00:15.186 --> 00:00:16.558
and explainable fixes.

00:00:16.795 --> 00:00:18.433
Connect Shopify read-only,

00:00:18.508 --> 00:00:20.135
or upload a product CSV.

00:00:20.372 --> 00:00:21.281
Review first.

00:00:21.552 --> 00:00:22.600
Fix with confidence.

00:00:22.837 --> 00:00:24.074
Run your catalog audit at

00:00:24.098 --> 00:00:25.540
getstorecheck.eu
